\x1b[2mNote: Prefer 'openacp config' instead — it works whether daemon is running or not.\x1b[0m
`,
      'restart': `
\x1b[1mopenacp api restart\x1b[0m — Restart the daemon

\x1b[1mUsage:\x1b[0m
  openacp api restart

